  "url": "manual-documents-and-certificates.html#notes",
  "text": "Tap the note button beside a document (the small page icon, left of ✓) to add a note, such as \"Assessor booked for Friday\". The note shows in purple under the document's name. You can also touch and hold the document and choose Add / edit note . Notes appear on the handover PDF and, for documents still missing, on the progress report."
