  "text": "Whenever a document's status changes, KeyCheck saves the date. You don't have to do anything. A short grey line under the document's name shows where it stands, for example: Requested today Waiting 5 days · chased yesterday Received 3 Nov The full dates are on the document's history screen, the progress report and the PDFs."
