  "text": "When you chase a document that still hasn't arrived: Touch and hold the document. (This option only appears when the document is Outstanding.) Choose Mark as chased today . The grey line and the progress report then show the date of the latest chase. You can also tap Mark as chased today on the document's history screen. There it works for Not checked documents too, and marks them Outstanding from today, so their waiting time starts. To remove a chase recorded by mistake, swipe left on it in the history and tap Delete . Only chases can be deleted. Other entries stay, so the record of when things happened is complete."
