  "text": "The ⋯ button beside each group's name changes every document in that group at once. The button beside All documents does the same for every document on the plot. Choose: Mark all as received Mark all as outstanding Mark all as not applicable Clear all These changes are dated too. A banner offers Undo straight afterwards."
